{"id": "EUVD-2026-96598", "enisaUuid": "32babafe-be9a-37d1-a942-cf0de3ff9ae9", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the SysTenantController listPackByTenantUserId handler that allows any authenticated user to query tenant product packs. Low-privileged attackers can supply arbitrary tenantId and userId parameters to enumerate any tenant's product pack configuration and reveal which users are tenant administrators.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T12:41:21", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_tenant_pack_by_user.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysTenantController.java#L1034-L1047", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sys-tenant-listpackbytenantuserid"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108659", "GHSA-x5p8-h4j8-4cch"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1275e420-e374-3f39-ac40-bf475763e7a6", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "16c0baaf-3c06-3bf9-a5e6-58c2326d8251", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}